'''La Solana''' ({{Literal translation|the sunny side}}) also known as the '''Bayaran Riviera''' ({{Langx|an|La Riviera de Bayarés}}) is an emerging [[Megaregions of Balisca|megaregion]] in the [[Balisca|Baliscan Confederation]]. It's the second most populous megalopolis within Balisca (after [[Concordia]]), with a population exceeding 19 million residents (representing 13.26% of Balisca's total population). It includes the major cities of [[Macaio]], [[San Chorche]], and [[San Xoán de Baxes]] along with their {{W|satellite city|satellites cities}} such as [[Sant Agustín]].

